  "notes": [
    "Two irregularities combine: e→ie stem change + g→gu spelling change before e",
    "Stem change (e→ie): affects all present tense forms except nosotros (*riego, riegas, riega, regamos, riegan*)",
    "Spelling change (g→gu): affects yo pretérito indefinido (*regué*) and subjuntivo presente to preserve hard /g/",
    "Nosotros reverts to infinitive stem in subjuntivo presente: *reguemos* (not ~~*rieguemos*~~)",
    "Past participle: regado (regular)",
    "*Regar las plantas* = to water the plants; *regar el jardín* = to water the garden",
    "Related: el riego (irrigation, watering), la regadera (watering can)"
  ],
  "sourceFile": "Verbs/r/Regar.md"
